OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy in
OL,6,Fthe evening with rain spreading into
OL,7,Fthe west and becoming heavy at times.
OL,8,FRain continues eastwards overnight to
OL,9,Fcover all areas. Strong winds through
OL,10,Fthe evening, easing overnight.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FRain, heavy at times, clears
OL,13,Fto the east through the morning. The
OL,14,Fafternoon will see increasingly bright
OL,15,Fspells developing with the odd shower
OL,16,Fpossible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
